flowchart LR
    C[Clients] --> GW[API gateway]
    GW --> SA[Search API] --> AG[Aggregator] --> AD[Supplier adapters<br/>one per airline, GDS or NDC source]
    AD --> SUP[External suppliers]
    SA --> RC[(Redis results cache)]
    AG --> OS[(Offers store)]
    GW --> BK[Booking service<br/>saga state machine,<br/>idempotency]
    BK --> AD
    BK --> PAY[Payment service<br/>authorize, capture, void]
    PAY --> PSP[PSP]
    BK --> BDB[(Bookings DB<br/>booking, step log, outbox)]
    BDB -->|outbox relay| K[Kafka]
    K --> RS[Pending resolver<br/>queries supplier by reference]
    RS --> AD
    RS --> BK
    K --> DN[Email, ledger, analytics,<br/>supplier reconciliation]
